    "updated_at": "2026-10-31T07:54:19Z",
    "body": "Confirmed at the tag: `submit_with`'s doc (src/stream.rs) says a room's bytes on entry are unspecified and reused across streams, and that a program keeping one caller's secrets from another reads none of them first. With #204's fix, `fill` writes the whole room before it's hashed. Closing.\n\n\u2014 Sam Shackleton\n",
